### 1. External payment provider issue
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/incidents/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Customers complain that card payments often fail, and transactions do not go through. payment-service logs show many timeouts when calling PayGate, starting from 12:05 UTC. Other services look normal."
}

### 2. DB degradation caused by reporting
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/incidents/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "p95 latency of /payments/create jumped to 6 seconds after 02:00 UTC. PostgreSQL CPU is at 95% and pg_stat_activity shows long-running export queries from reporting-service. api-gateway returns 504 Gateway Timeout to some clients."
}

### 3. Notification delivery issue
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/incidents/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Users are not receiving SMS one-time codes for top-up confirmation since 09:40 UTC. notification-service logs show HTTP 503 responses from the SMS gateway. Payments and balances are processed normally."
}

